# Hunter Linux - browser-based administration.
#
# cockpit      the web service, the login page and the bridge that runs
#              privileged operations on behalf of an authenticated user
# cockpit-system
#              the Terminal, Services, Logs, Storage and Accounts pages
#
# Cockpit authenticates with the accounts of this computer through PAM, so the
# live session account and the account created by the installer both work with
# the password they already have.  Nothing else is configured here.
cockpit
cockpit-system
# curl is what the smoke tests use to talk to Cockpit, and it is the command
# most people reach for when checking a network service.
curl
